<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech brewer Radegast Q1 gross profit up.</title>
<headline>Czech brewer Radegast Q1 gross profit up.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three month period ending March 31, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		    97.71    vs	   59.76</p>
<p> Operating profit	     105.06    vs	   67.45</p>
</text>
